    "contentHTML": "\n<div class=\"learn-intro\">\n  Despite its abundant resources, Nigeria continues to face several significant <span class=\"learn-keyword\">challenges</span> that hinder its economic development, requiring coordinated policy responses to overcome.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">1. Key Economic Development Challenges Facing Nigeria</h3>\n<div class=\"learn-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"learn-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Challenge</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>Corruption</td><td>Misuse of public resources and office for private gain, diverting funds from development projects</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Infrastructure deficit</td><td>Inadequate power supply, poor roads, and limited access to reliable infrastructure hindering business activity</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Unemployment</td><td>A large proportion of the workforce, especially youths, unable to find productive employment</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Over-dependence on oil</td><td>Heavy reliance on oil revenue, leaving the economy vulnerable to global price fluctuations</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Insecurity</td><td>Conflict, terrorism, and crime disrupting economic activities in various regions</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Weak institutions</td><td>Ineffective governance structures and rule of law undermining policy implementation and investor confidence</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Poverty and inequality</td><td>A significant proportion of the population living below the poverty line, with uneven distribution of wealth</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">2. Interconnection Between Challenges</h3>\n<p class=\"learn-p\">These challenges are often interconnected — for example, weak institutions can enable corruption, which diverts funds meant for infrastructure, which in turn discourages investment and worsens unemployment, creating a cycle that is difficult to break without comprehensive reform.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">3. Suggested Solutions</h3>\n<ul class=\"learn-list\">\n  <li>Strengthening anti-corruption institutions and enforcing accountability</li>\n  <li>Increasing investment in critical infrastructure, particularly power supply</li>\n  <li>Diversifying the economy away from oil dependency into manufacturing, agriculture, and services</li>\n  <li>Investing in skills training and education to reduce youth unemployment</li>\n  <li>Improving security through better policing and addressing root causes of conflict</li>\n  <li>Strengthening governance institutions and the rule of law to build investor confidence</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"learn-tip-box\">\n  <span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">💡</span>\n  <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> When listing Nigeria's development challenges in an essay, always briefly explain HOW each challenge specifically hinders development, rather than just naming it — this shows deeper understanding and typically earns more marks.\n</div>\n",
